@startuml
title State diagram for BPO Management System Search Functionality

[*] --> InitialSearch : Start

state "Initial Search" as InitialSearch
InitialSearch : entry / start state
InitialSearch : do / display initial search options

state "Filter by Category" as FilterCategory
FilterCategory : entry / selected category filter
FilterCategory : do / apply category filter and display results

state "Filter by Price Range" as FilterPriceRange
FilterPriceRange : entry / selected price range filter
FilterPriceRange : do / apply price range filter and display results

state "Display Matching Users" as DisplayMatchingUsers
DisplayMatchingUsers : entry / matching users displayed based on criteria
DisplayMatchingUsers : exit / search completed

InitialSearch --> FilterCategory : Select Category Filter
InitialSearch --> FilterPriceRange : Select Price Range Filter

FilterCategory --> DisplayMatchingUsers : Apply Filter and Display
FilterPriceRange --> DisplayMatchingUsers : Apply Filter and Display

DisplayMatchingUsers --> [*] : End Search

@enduml
